---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Teleprompter Tips & Speaker Notes Guides - CueCard Blog"
description: "Teleprompter tips for filming on your phone, and speaker notes workflows for presenting on Zoom, Google Meet and Teams. From the team behind CueCard Teleprompter."
keywords: "cuecard blog, speaker notes tips, teleprompter tips, presentation workflows, zoom speaker notes, google meet notes, teams presenter notes"
canonical: "https://cuecard.dev/blog/"
ogTitle: "CueCard Blog"
ogDescription: "Speaker notes tips, teleprompter workflows, and presentation best practices."
ogImageWidth: "1280"
ogImageHeight: "640"
ogLocale: "en_US"
pageName: "CueCard Blog"
crumbs:
  - name: "CueCard"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Blog"
    url: "/blog/"
---
{% block jsonld %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Blog",
    "@id": "https://cuecard.dev/blog/#blog",
    "name": "CueCard Blog",
    "description": "Speaker notes tips, teleprompter workflows, and presentation best practices.",
    "url": "https://cuecard.dev/blog/",
    "inLanguage": "en",
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cuecard.dev/#org" },
    "blogPost": [
        {% for blog in blogs %}
        {
            "@type": "BlogPosting",
            "@id": "https://cuecard.dev/blog/{{ blog.slug }}/#post",
            "headline": {{ blog.title | dump | safe }},
            "url": "https://cuecard.dev/blog/{{ blog.slug }}/",
            "datePublished": "{{ blog.datetime }}",
            "author": { "@type": "Person", "name": {{ blog.author | dump | safe }} }
        }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
    ]
}
</script>
{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
{% from "partials/icons.njk" import icon %}
{% include "partials/nav.njk" %}

<main class="blog-page">
    <section class="blog-hero" aria-labelledby="blog-h">
        <div class="wrap">
            {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
            <h1 class="display" id="blog-h">How to talk to a <em>camera</em>.</h1>
            <p class="body">
                Teleprompter tips for filming on a phone, and speaker notes workflows for
                presenting on a computer. Short, practical, and written by the people who
                make the app.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-list solid" aria-label="Posts">
        <div class="wrap">
            {% for blog in blogs %}
            <article class="blog-entry reveal">
                <p class="blog-meta">
                    <time datetime="{{ blog.datetime }}">{{ blog.datetime }}</time>
                    <span class="blog-meta-separator">&middot;</span>
                    <span class="blog-author">{{ blog.author }}</span>
                </p>
                <h2 class="blog-entry-title">
                    <a href="/blog/{{ blog.slug }}/">{{ blog.title }}</a>
                </h2>
                <div class="blog-entry-content">
                    {{ blog.content | markdownExcerpt | safe }}
                </div>
                <a class="blog-entry-link" href="/blog/{{ blog.slug }}/">Read full post {{ icon("arrow", 14) }}</a>
            </article>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </section>

    {% set getHeading = "Read it later. Download it now." %}
    {% set getBody = "A floating teleprompter on your phone, invisible speaker notes on your computer. Both free." %}
    {% include "partials/getcuecard.njk" %}
</main>

{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
{% endblock %}
